      "after": "Two-lane timeline on a day-count scale, 9 July 2025 to 26 August 2025, each event marked by its status. Financing lane: Joint commitment, effective, 9 July 2025; Equity priced, implementation, 16 July 2025; Revolver signed, effective, 25 August 2025. Commitment and context lane: Apple agreement, announcement, 15 July 2025; Commitment expired, implementation, 26 August 2025.",
