      "before": "Waterfall bridge, USD million",
      "after": "Waterfall bridge, USD million: 31 Dec 2025 1,830.3; Operating cash flow −7.8; Cash capital spending −420.3; Government award proceeds +6.5; Financing cash flows −91.1; Accretion +20.9; Restricted-cash release +0.8; Valuation change −1.4; 30 Sep 2026 1,337.9.",
      "derived_from": "spec.json slides[6].exhibit.data"
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "mcid": 5,
      "kind": "diagram",
      "before": "",
      "after": "State diagram. Revolver states under credit agreement Section 8.01(m); the revolver was available at 30 September 2026. States: Available ($203m drawable); Draws blocked (Default: no new loans or LCs); Grace extended (Cash at least $343.75m); Event of Default (Day 60 without a certificate, or day 90; lenders may act). Current state as of 30 September 2026: Available. Transitions: Available to Draws blocked on Defense payment duty suspended or released; Draws blocked to Available on Obligation restored; Draws blocked to Grace extended on Day 60, cash certificate; Grace extended to Event of Default on Day 90 unresolved; Available to Event of Default on Terminable default, lapse or disaffirmation.",
      "derived_from": "spec.json slides[7].exhibit.data"
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "mcid": 19,
      "kind": "diagram",
      "before": "",
      "after": "Milestone timeline on a day-count scale, 2025 to 2030; reported dates come from filings, contractual dates from the credit agreement, and conditional dates apply only if a stated term is met. Revolver signed, reported, 25 August 2025; Covenant trigger deadline, contractual, 14 August 2027; First leverage test, latest, contractual, 30 September 2027; Springing maturity, conditional, 30 November 2029; 2030 notes mature, reported, 1 March 2030.",
      "derived_from": "spec.json slides[9].exhibit.data"
    },
    {
      "page": 12,
      "mcid": 16,
      "kind": "diagram",
      "before": "",
      "after": "Hub-and-spoke diagram with MP Materials at the centre and 4 spokes of equal length that carry no magnitude. NdPr price protection: Floor-price payments; revolver trigger; 10X offtake: Purchase commitment; revolver trigger; Initial preferred: Government cash consideration, $400m; Additional preferred: Fallback if net financing under $350m.",
      "derived_from": "spec.json slides[10].exhibit.data"
    },
    {
      "page": 15,
      "mcid": 24,
      "kind": "diagram",
      "before": "",
      "after": "Decision tree. Illustrative clause arithmetic with hypothetical inputs, not reported MP results. Is a minimum payment applicable? if No, No adjustment; if Yes, (Minimum versus attributable income: if Min. higher, (Does later cash repeat the addback: if No, Addback of 20; if Yes, Net reduction of 20); if Income higher, No addback). Highlighted outcome: Net reduction of 20.",
      "derived_from": "spec.json slides[13].exhibit.data"
    },
    {
