      "kind": "diagram",
      "before": "",
      "after": "Decision tree. Decision conditions for a hypothetical sponsor; the highlighted route ends at the recommendation. Equity window open on acceptable terms? if No, Committed debt or delay; if Yes, (Cost to finish above cash on hand: if Yes, Raise more equity first; if No, (Defense payments at risk of suspension or dispute: if Yes, Fund on cash; treat revolver as unavailable; if No, (Covenant EBITDA below about $232m at first test: if Yes, Equity only, or amend first; if No, Equity plus revolver))). Highlighted outcome: Equity plus revolver.",
